From: tao3k team and Contributors
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] compiler: reuse Darwin runtime objects in executable graphs

Freeze the measured D851 executable-graph-scoped candidate on staging V19.
This patch layers after 0002 and 0003. It is an investigation candidate,
not part of the four-patch release workflow; see the D851 receipt for the
real-consumer A/B and remaining admission failures.

---
